  "body": "65 Ta Moko Drive, Gulf Harbour\r\n\r\n4 BED · 3 BATH · 2 LIVING · DOUBLE GARAGE\r\n2 ENSUITE BEDROOMS\r\n498m² LAND · APPROX. 200m² HOME · APPROX. 90m² DECK\r\n\r\nA DESIGNER’S OWN HOME\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed, beautifully finished and easy to live in.\r\n\r\nCreated by its owner, an experienced interior designer, this contemporary Gulf Harbour home has been carefully considered from the floor plan and spatial zoning through to the cabinetry, lighting, materials and indoor-outdoor connection.\r\n\r\nThe split-level layout creates a natural separation between the main living areas and the quieter bedroom wing, while the light-filled kitchen, dining and living spaces connect easily with approximately 90m² of outdoor decking.\r\n\r\n1. DESIGNER-OWNED HOME\r\n\r\nThis is a home where the details have been considered as part of one complete design.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\n* Spanish tiles\r\n* German flooring\r\n* Custom-designed kitchen, wardrobes and storage\r\n* 2.2m extra-high acoustic internal doors\r\n* Insulated and acoustically treated internal walls\r\n* Underfloor heating in all three bathrooms\r\n* Central ducted air conditioning\r\n* Designer window furnishings already installed throughout\r\n\r\nSome of the most valuable features are the ones you may not immediately see — but they make a real difference to everyday comfort.\r\n\r\n2. MOVE-IN READY OPTION\r\n\r\nFor buyers looking for an easier move, this home offers a genuine move-in-ready option.\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms have newly purchased beds and mattresses, and all window furnishings are already installed. Subject to an acceptable offer, these may remain with the property.\r\n\r\nFor the right offer, the owner is also happy to discuss a designer-selected furnishing package, including new living and dining furniture chosen to complement the home. Selected outdoor furniture may also be available by negotiation.\r\n\r\nA particularly convenient option for families relocating to Auckland, overseas buyers or first-home buyers who would prefer to settle in without having to furnish an entire home from scratch.\r\n\r\n3. FLEXIBLE LIVING · INCOME POTENTIAL\r\n\r\nThe home has four bedrooms and three bathrooms, including two ensuite bedrooms, giving family members and guests excellent privacy.\r\n\r\nA separate one-bedroom area with its own bathroom, kitchenette/bar and independent access provides even more flexibility.\r\n\r\nIt could work well for extended family, guests, a teenager or working from home, with potential for additional income subject to the buyer satisfying themselves as to any proposed rental use.\r\n\r\n4. APPROX. 90m² OF OUTDOOR LIVING\r\n\r\nApproximately 90m² of decking substantially extends the living space.\r\n\r\nLarge openings connect the kitchen, dining and living areas with the outdoors, creating an easy setting for entertaining, summer dining, family gatherings or simply relaxing outside.\r\n\r\nThe home also enjoys lawn and garden areas, giving it a good balance of indoor and outdoor living.\r\n\r\n5. QUALITY BEYOND THE SURFACE\r\n\r\nThis home has been designed with comfort in mind, including details that are often difficult to appreciate during a short viewing:\r\n\r\n* Internal-wall insulation and acoustic treatment\r\n* Underfloor heating to all three bathrooms\r\n* Central ducted air conditioning\r\n* Extra-high internal doors\r\n* Generous custom storage\r\n* Quality flooring, tiles and cabinetry\r\n* Thoughtful separation between living and sleeping zones\r\n\r\n6. THE GULF HARBOUR LIFESTYLE\r\n\r\nEnjoy the coastal lifestyle with Gulf Harbour Marina, boating, fishing, golf and open green spaces all close by.\r\n\r\nThe property provides approximately 7.5m of driveway space suitable for boat parking, making it particularly appealing for buyers who enjoy getting out on the water.\r\n\r\nWentworth College & Primary are approximately 2km away, while nearby Shakespear Regional Park offers beaches, walking tracks, native wildlife and beautiful coastal scenery.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS\r\n\r\n4 Bedrooms\r\n3 Bathrooms including 2 Ensuites\r\n2 Living Areas\r\nDouble Garage\r\n498m² Land\r\nApprox. 200m² Home\r\nApprox. 90m² Deck\r\nSeparate flexible one-bedroom area with independent access\r\nApprox. 7.5m driveway space suitable for boat parking\r\nMove-in-ready furnishing options available by negotiation\r\n\r\nPRIVATE SALE — DIRECT FROM THE OWNER\r\n\r\nBest contact time: Monday–Sunday, 9:00 am–7:00 pm\r\n\r\nOPEN HOMES\r\n\r\nPlease check the Open Home section of this Trade Me listing for the latest confirmed times.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings are also welcome by appointment.\r\n\r\nYuling He\r\n022 638 9588\r\nrainbow6389588@gmail.com",
